WEBVTT

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.450
Wh-What should we do?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.040
Take him to the hospital?

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.580
No. There's no point in
taking him to the hospital.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.660
We can only wait for the pain to subside.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.790
Natsu, you don't need
intravenous fluids yet, right?

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.290
Yeah. I don't.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.040
Let's cool down the area for now.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.830
Does your right leg feel numb?

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.950
Yeah...

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:48.580
Yasunari. Go to class.
It's first period, right?

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.580
B-But...

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.080
It's fine.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:55.120
I took some pain killers,
so I'll feel better really soon.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.370
This happens sometimes. Don't worry.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.620
Please take a lot of class notes for me.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.910
I don't want to be held back again...

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.700
There aren't enough towels here,
so I'll get some from my room.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.330
Let's go, Yasunari.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.910
Yasunari!

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.700
I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.500
I think you've stayed
in the starting line-up.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:22.410
Yeah...

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:26.250
He probably won't be able to move all day.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.370
Take care of his classes.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.580
Is this my fault?

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:34.250
A few times, when he helped me practice...

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.160
...I knocked him over...

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.120
Do you think that was the cause?

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:41.370
Even if it was, it's not your fault.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.410
But...!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:46.500
If he could, he wanted to come
back to the team as a player.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:50.120
I'm sure he wanted to practice
and move his body.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.620
Lately, he looks like he's having fun.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.580
He's the one who wanted
to practice with you.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:00.120
So, it's his own fault
if he aggravated his own injury.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.450
It was something I couldn't do for him.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.750
Please keep supporting him.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.950
"A novice cook will fail at food arrangement
almost 100% of the time."

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.660
It's not like I caught a cold.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.080
That scared me!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.620
Say you're awake if you're awake!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.370
I just woke up. What time is it?

00:03:55.370 --> 00:04:00.540
Noon. I brought you some rice porridge.
Take some pain killers after you eat.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.160
So annoying...

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.330
What's annoying?!

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:08.580
I'm the one that's hurting,
but you're the one that's all depressed.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.080
Isn't it okay for me to get
a little depressed about this?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.040
It's not. You're an eyesore.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.500
I'm glad you seem to be doing okay.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.000
I'm going to sit you up.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.910
Yasunari. Was he feeling depressed?

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.330
Who knows?

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.750
Tea.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:31.370
Except for a few, I feel like everyone
in the club will be overly concerned...

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.950
This sucks...

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.500
Well, that can't be helped.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.450
But it still sucks. And, I'm sure
this'll keep happening...

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.580
--Natsusa--
--Shut up.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.000
Sh-Shut up?!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:47.500
Do you think saying some old cliché
words to cheer me up would really

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:52.830
make me say something like, "Okay! I feel
better now. I'm going to recover quickly!"

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.750
Are you stupid? Do you have an IQ of three?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:59.540
Yeah. I haven't said anything yet.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:04.700
You just need to stay quiet and
keep your promise, Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.040
All right. All right.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:08.950
Here.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.450
How is Yuzuki doing?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.200
He's doing better than
he was in the morning.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.870
Ibuki-<i>san </i>is watching him now.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.500
I see.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:24.040
By the way, you said you were having
some problems with your kick.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.870
How is that going?

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:27.250
I've gotten worse.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.830
Why?

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.370
I don't know.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:40.120
Shingyouji. They say that humans
have 108 earthly desires.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:44.790
That's why humans make themselves suffer.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:49.000
The pain you feel is something that stems
from one of those earthly desires.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:56.040
First, shouldn't you think about which
of those earthly desires is afflicting you?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.250
Do you understand?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.580
No, not at all.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.700
To begin with, I don't
understand your Japanese.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.450
I see.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.410
That's fine, too.

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.290
Now, let's eat.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:12.120
Thank you for the meal.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.790
Thank goodness! They finally ate!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:20.250
They stared expressionlessly at each other
without eating for 30 minutes...

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.330
I thought it was some kinda training!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:24.450
I'm sure Gandhi would be surprised, too...

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.330
The second years are a gathering
of low-key weirdos, after all...

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.750
Natsusa and Konoe are the ones
who usually stand out,

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.660
but I think those three are
the really dangerous ones...

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:39.040
By the way, it seems like Natsusa hurt
his neck and can't come to practice today...

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.620
What?! Really?

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:44.330
Hernias are so troublesome
once you get it once.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.370
I was thinking of stopping
by Natsusa's room today.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.870
What about all of you, Senpai?

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.450
Yeah, let's go.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:54.870
"Today's Menu" "Mix sports drinks
*Careful of each player's preference"
"Prepare to ice people down and tape them"

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.290
"Today's Menu" "Mix sports drinks
*Careful of each player's preference"
"Prepare to ice people down and tape them"
Um...

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.410
Next is...

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.080
Are you all right?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.540
Do you need help?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.000
Oh! No! Not at all! I couldn't ask that!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.660
I'm fine!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.660
Um, Yuu...

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:07.160
Yes!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:11.700
"Fourth Year College Student" "Yuuki Koreeda"
"Number 18, Reserve"
D-Do you know where my
Moka-<i>chan </i>water bottle is?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.700
Huh? P-Please wait a moment!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.290
Hey, Yuuki.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.580
Yuu-<i>kun </i>is busy right now. You should
look for something like that yourself.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:26.750
B-But... Yuzuki usually has it ready for me
so I don't know where it normally is.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.580
I lose my motivation without it...

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.580
I found it!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.910
"Doesn't it frustrate you?"
Isn't this it?

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.870
"Doesn't it frustrate you?"
Thank you!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:36.040
Huh? Shinya-<i>senpai</i>!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:41.410
Did you finish stretching?
Natsusa-<i>san </i>told me to help you...

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:42.250
"Fourth Year College Student" "Shinya Ishigami"
"Number 4, Left Lock"

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.120
"Fourth Year College Student" "Shinya Ishigami"
"Number 4, Left Lock"
Oh, I had Ren help me today.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.290
I'm very sorry...

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.160
Yuu!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:47.580
"Fourth Year College Student" "Ren Tamashiro"
"Number 5, Right Lock"

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.540
"Fourth Year College Student" "Ren Tamashiro"
"Number 5, Right Lock"
Do you think you'll have
my special drink ready?!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:53.580
Oh! P-Please wait a moment!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.910
I will check right now!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:08:00.580
Ren-<i>san</i>, please settle for a normal drink today.
He is very busy without Natsusa.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.950
Guess that's true.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:07.540
And a small change like that won't
affect my great trapezial muscles!

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.700
How is Natsusa?

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.410
He is doing a lot better.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.120
Okay. Let's start practice.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.290
Yeah!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.910
Why at a time like this?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.120
Number 11! Number 11...

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.080
"10 Ibuki Ueoka"
"11 Yasunari Tsuru"
"12 Ikuto Yufu"

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.000
"10 Ibuki Ueoka"
And...

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.120
"Fuuga" "Zanitsu" "Yamada"
"Uchinashi" "Ishigami" "Tamashiro" "Sasaki" "Taylor"
"Hidaka" "Yufu" "Ueoka" "Konoe"
"Tsuru" "Shingyouji" "Li"

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.870
"Natsusa Yuzuki: I saw the announcement!"
"Natsusa Yuzuki: You did it, Yasunari!"
"Natsusa Yuzuki:"

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:57.910
"Natsusa Yuzuki: I want some gelatin."
"Natsusa Yuzuki: Orange flavored."
"Natsusa Yuzuki:" "You did a great job."

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.410
"Natsusa Yuzuki: I want some gelatin."
"Natsusa Yuzuki: Orange flavored."
"Natsusa Yuzuki:" "You did a great job."
So high and mighty...

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.700
Ibuki! Don't drag us down!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.000
Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.200
That's right!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.620
Your matchmaking parties
were completely useless,

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:10.500
so at least be of use of the field.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.620
I'm seriously going to kill you!
I did it three times for you!

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.830
True, but I didn't get
a single chance out of it!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:21.250
I told you! Don't try to push yourself
on someone within the same day!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.160
"Tone: You have no new messages."

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:40.080
Hey, Taisei.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.870
When we go see Natsusa,

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.620
should we bring him a heat pack
you can microwave?

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.410
Didn't you have one in your room?

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.580
I'm not going, so you take it with you.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.040
Why?

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.290
No reason.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.040
If we all tried to go,
we'd wouldn't all fit in his room.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.870
It'll be fine! We'll take turns.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.500
Taisei, I won't be going.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:04.370
Huh?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.950
Well, I won't be going, so you should go.

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:10.580
--Natsusa was worried about
your stretch menu today--

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.830
--Who the hell are you?
--Natsusa was worried about
your stretch menu today--

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:17.040
You think I'm not going
because I hate you?

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:21.870
You're right. I won't go because of you.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.120
Taisei!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.830
Playing as a team is the most
important thing in rugby.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:30.370
You messed that up and
had the gall to come back.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:33.500
Now you're a starting player?
You looking down on the sport?

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.870
Stop it, Taisei...

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.870
You guys, too!

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.660
This is all because you
forgave him so easily!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.120
That's why this guy is so cocky!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.620
Listen. I don't want
to play rugby with you,

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.370
and I won't accept you as a team member.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.200
Taisei!

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.750
What are you doing?

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:05.250
What, you ask? I'm putting up a
Moka-<i>chan </i>poster to make you feel better.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:09.500
Koreeda-<i>senpai</i>, please don't
step on Natsu-<i>senpai</i>.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.250
Be careful, Yuuki.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.620
More importantly,
please stop him from doing this.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:15.580
--Natsusa! You need
more muscles, after all!

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.950
--Okay! Done. Whew.
--Natsusa! You need
more muscles, after all!

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.790
Don't depend on your bones
and use your muscles to support you!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.790
Why are you naked, Tamashiro-<i>senpai</i>?

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:29.790
I wanted you to see my beautiful
muscles and get better faster!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:34.000
If you don't want me to sue you for
muscle harassment, please put on clothes...

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.660
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.580
What are you doing?!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.500
Thai massage.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.250
Chinese massage.

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:47.750
You're getting international massages
on each foot. Natsusa, you're global.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.040
What are you doing, Su-<i>san</i>?

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.950
What, you ask?

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:59.330
I'm gonna write a get better message.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.040
Where?

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.580
Where are you writing?!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:03.450
--Wait! Hey, are you listening?!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.290
--It'll be over soon.
--Wait! Hey, are you listening?!

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:07.660
--It'll be over soon.
--Seriously, don't write anything weird!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.870
Don't worry so much. There. Done.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:12.370
"Country Bumpkin"

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.580
"Country Bumpkin"
I really hope this is
a water-based marker!

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.580
What are you doing?

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:23.200
Oh, nothing. I just brought
Natsusa-<i>san </i>something to eat,

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:26.250
but the room is currently full,
so I am waiting outside.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:29.660
It's fine. Just force yourself in.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:31.200
Right, Gakuto?

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:36.000
Yeah. It's about time
the first group leaves.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.660
The Kansai group and third-year
students are coming soon.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:43.580
Natsusa-<i>san </i>is really loved by everyone.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:48.790
He pays attention to the individual
needs of everyone on the team.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.750
I'm still so lacking...

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.410
By the way, what did you make?

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.000
Oh, yes.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.660
It is my original stew!

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:04.660
To ensure its nutrition, I have added fish,
cake, protein, and herbal medicine!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:06.000
Sounds good.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.830
Yasunari, how does it look?
Did it come off?

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.910
It came off, but your forehead is red.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.750
I can tell. It stings.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:25.580
On top of that, my tongue has been
numb after eating Yuu's stew.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.950
Why didn't anyone stop
him in the first place?

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:33.580
I'm sorry. I didn't know Yuu
was bringing something like that.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.500
I think it's been about 20 minutes
since we put the ice pack on.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.870
Don't we need to warm the area up next?

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:45.000
I'll go microwave the pack that
Hidaka-<i>senpai </i>brought with him.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:52.660
Oh! Tsuru-<i>kun</i>!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.330
What are you doing?

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:58.120
Some of the stew was left over,
so I was packing it up.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.160
I'm going to make porridge
with this tomorrow.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.120
Sounds good.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:06.120
I'm sorry about today, Tsuru-<i>kun</i>.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.250
I couldn't tape you up very well...

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:12.080
You're still new at it,
so it can't be helped.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:17.250
But, Natsusa-<i>san </i>can do it...

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:23.790
Natsusa-<i>san </i>is like magic.
He continues to get so much done.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:29.910
But I couldn't even finish half of the
work that Natsusa-<i>san </i>usually does today.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:33.700
But you can do the things
Natsusa-<i>san </i>can't, right?

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:34.830
Huh?

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:40.500
You manage the club finances, order
our equipment, and update the website...

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.200
You even made an app for us, too.

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.540
You work a bit slow, but you
take care in everything you do.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.540
I think rugby is the same.

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:53.040
Each person depends on their team members
to do the things that they can't do.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.540
That's how a team reaches
its highest potential.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.790
Aren't managers and trainers the same?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.660
Though I don't really know.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.330
Why are you crying?!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.660
I'm sorry! I couldn't help it!

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.870
B-But I was just so happy.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:18.870
When I couldn't become a player,
I thought I was perfect for a manager...

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:21.330
But today, I couldn't get anything done

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.160
and caused everyone so much trouble...

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:28.160
I was worried that there was
just no place for me here...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:32.870
So, I was really happy with
your words Tsuru-<i>kun</i>!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.910
Yasunari.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:34.790
Huh?

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:39.290
Call me Yasunari. I'm not
used to being called, Tsuru.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.250
And, I'll call you Yuu...

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.500
Yes!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.790
What are you doing?

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:52.410
I'm just watching the blooming
youth of the rugby club...

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:54.580
What kind of catch phrase copy is that?

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:58.040
My tongue...

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:01.250
Hey, Yasunari. My tongue is still...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.660
Huh? You came again?

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:04.950
How are you feeling?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.540
Much better than this afternoon.

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.660
What's wrong?

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.750
Your forehead is all red.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:19.000
I'm so weak right now and I've been
treated the worst I've ever been treated.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:22.410
Good for you. They weren't overly distant.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.700
Did Taisei come to visit?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.660
He didn't come, now that I think of it.

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:29.160
I see...

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.450
Senpai...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:37.580
Please put your head down
and look up at the ceiling.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.700
--Huh?
--Just do it.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.450
What is this?

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:46.290
Now, try pushing this button.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:52.080
Cheer up, meow!
Moka is cheering for you, meow!

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.870
Do you feel better?

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:58.080
No. I'm more distracted by
the weird smell coming from you.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:01.660
I ate the stew that Yuu
brought for me earlier.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:06.250
You smell like food waste that's
been sprayed with bleach...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:11.200
Even though I lost to Yuu's pureness,
I can't believe I ate all of that...

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:15.000
Huh? Isn't Sei with you?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:17.700
Now that you mention it,
I haven't seen him...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.700
Oh, that's right!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.250
I have to go and bring the cooler box!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.330
That's right!

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.160
Oh! Please stay here, Natsusa-<i>san</i>!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.830
Huh? I'm fine now!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:48.500
No, no! I will do all
the heavy lifting today!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.410
--But...
--It's fine! Please leave it to me!

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:55.450
Yuu-<i>kun </i>seems really motivated today.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:56.950
Yes, he does.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.950
Um! Tora-<i>nii</i>! I want
to go to the restroom!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.500
--Me, too!
--Me, too!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.580
Okay! Then, repeat after me!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:08.540
We will not fight!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:13.540
We won't be provoked by the other team!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.410
--What are they doing?
--We won't provoke them, either!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.950
--Well, last year, a fight broke out when
we played a match against this team...
--We won't provoke them, either!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.450
--Well, last year, a fight broke out when
we played a match against this team...
--Rugby is a gentleman's sport!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:24.500
--The match was almost cancelled...
--Rugby is a gentleman's sport!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:25.580
Yeah. Yeah.

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.080
Last year was really troublesome...

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:32.160
Really troublesome, my ass.
Weren't you the two that provoked them?

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:35.080
The other team got irritated
and picked a fight with them

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.790
which started the brawl, right?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:40.160
We didn't provoke them, did we, Su-<i>san</i>?

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.200
We just had a little chat with them,
didn't we, Natsu-<i>san</i>?

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:46.160
The first years are the ones
who get picked on every year.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:52.000
Last year, we had two sinister and three
uninterested first years, so it worked out.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:55.080
This year we have a lot of hot-blooded
first years, so I'm worried...

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:59.250
Ikuto-<i>san</i>. I've captured
the two more worrisome ones!

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:03.790
Thank you, Takumi. You're the only one
with a cool head on your shoulders.

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.580
I-I won't start a fight!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.160
You started a fight just recently!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:13.160
Ren-<i>san </i>and Shin, please hold
down the other dangerous one.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:16.580
We need to make sure
not to start a fight this year.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:20.160
Okay! The three of you shouldn't fight
after agreeing to all of that.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.910
Don't let your guard down!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.330
Yes, sir!

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.830
Huh?

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:28.080
What're you looking at?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.700
--So fast!
--Hey!

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:30.790
Stop it!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.540
Don't glare at them.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:38.250
Poor Doushisha just lost against a team
they never thought they'd lose against.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:41.950
Yeah, that's true. That's why
we're going to win this time.

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:46.830
I heard that the team this year
was the worst to date.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:51.160
Huh?! Try saying that to our face
after winning a single game against us!

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.290
Losers!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.290
That's enough!

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:58.540
You, too! I'll tell your captain!

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.200
Hey, Ueoka.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:03.200
I heard you quit rugby for a while.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.500
Why?

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:08.250
'Cause you had an accident with
the bike you got from your daddy?

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:09.950
Something like that.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:10.870
What did you say?!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:11.830
--What? Come out and fight! This is bad!

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:12.660
--Hey!
--What? Come out and fight! This is bad!

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:13.790
You guys should come to us!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:16.000
--That's...
--Come on.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:19.160
That's none of your business!

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:22.370
Don't underestimate Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>!

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.750
Stop it!

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.450
Retreat for now!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.790
Why did you stop me?!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.250
You coward! People pleaser!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.660
That's right! Do you want to be popular
with men as well as women?!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.540
That's right! Why do so many girls talk
to you when you walk around campus?!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:46.160
The girl that came up and talked to you
in the cafeteria yesterday was my type!

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.410
Please introduce me to her.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.250
--Ow!
--Introduce me, my ass!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:56.500
But, Ibuki never introduces me to any girls!

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:00.580
That's right! He's a petty man that
wants to be popular on his own!

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.040
That's not the point!

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.500
And, you two! What are you doing?!

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.950
I'm sorry...

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.450
Natsusa!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.450
But...!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.910
--Natsusa! Where's your apology?!
--Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.160
--Natsusa! Where's your apology?!
--I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.620
I'm sorry!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:18.200
Natsusa-<i>san </i>is pretty
quick to start a fight...

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:20.290
Yeah. He's always been that way.

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.250
It must be hard for you.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.330
Well, he usually gets mad in my place.

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:26.750
Huh?

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:33.250
He gets mad for me or cries for me
with that small body of his,

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:36.450
so I end up being able
to keep myself cool.

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:47.120
Oh, of course, I get treated 13
times worse because of it.

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:49.580
That's a really specific number...

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:57.910
Whew, is that all of it? Okay!

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:04.910
Oh! Excuse me!

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:45.370
"Meditation is pretty hard."
It's so cold. Make sure not to get sick.

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:46.870
"Meditation is pretty hard."
It's a promise!
